; dectalk.def - the exports of the DECtalk DTC-01 v1.8 speech library, DECtalk.dll
; (REFERENCE.md s17). Names and ordinals are dapi's (dapi/src/dectalk.def): every dapi export is here, so dapi
; programs load it unchanged; the ones v1.8 has no counterpart for are stubs (s17.4). The [DTC01] additions start at
; 100. On Linux the same names are the exports of libtts_us.so.

LIBRARY      DECTALK

EXPORTS
    TextToSpeechStartup                 @1
    TextToSpeechShutdown                @2
    TextToSpeechSpeak                   @3
    TextToSpeechPause                   @4
    TextToSpeechResume                  @5
    TextToSpeechOpenWaveOutFile         @6
    TextToSpeechCloseWaveOutFile        @7
    TextToSpeechGetStatus               @8
    TextToSpeechReset                   @9
    TextToSpeechSync                    @10
    TextToSpeechGetRate                 @11
    TextToSpeechSetRate                 @12
    TextToSpeechGetSpeaker              @13
    TextToSpeechSetSpeaker              @14
    TextToSpeechGetLanguage             @15
    TextToSpeechSetLanguage             @16
    TextToSpeechGetCaps                 @17
    TextToSpeechLoadUserDictionary      @18
    TextToSpeechUnloadUserDictionary    @19
    TextToSpeechOpenInMemory            @20
    TextToSpeechCloseInMemory           @21
    TextToSpeechAddBuffer               @22
    TextToSpeechReturnBuffer            @23
    TextToSpeechOpenLogFile             @24
    TextToSpeechCloseLogFile            @25
    TextToSpeechStartupEx               @26
    TextToSpeechVersion                 @27
    TextToSpeechControlPanel            @28     ; stub
    TextToSpeechTyping                  @29     ; stub
    TextToSpeechGetLastError            @30
    TextToSpeechReserved1               @31     ; stub
    TextToSpeechReserved2               @32     ; stub
    TextToSpeechVersionEx               @33
    TextToSpeechStartLang               @34     ; one language
    TextToSpeechSelectLang              @35     ; one language
    TextToSpeechCloseLang               @36     ; one language
    TextToSpeechGetFeatures             @37
    TextToSpeechEnumLangs               @38     ; one language
    TextToSpeechReserved3               @39     ; stub
    TextToSpeechGetSpeakerParams        @40     ; stub (v1.8's parameters: @106/@107)
    TextToSpeechSetSpeakerParams        @41     ; stub
    TextToSpeechDictionaryHit           @42     ; stub for now
    TextToSpeechDumpDictionary          @43     ; stub for now
    TextToSpeechUserDictionaryHit       @44
    TextToSpeechDumpUserDictionary      @45
    TextToSpeechAddUserEntry            @46
    TextToSpeechDeleteUserEntry         @47
    TextToSpeechChangeUserPhoneme       @48
    TextToSpeechSaveUserDictionary      @49
    TextToSpeechConvertToPhonemes       @50     ; stub for now
    TextToSpeechTuning                  @51     ; stub
    TextToSpeechGetPhVdefParams         @52     ; stub

; [DTC01]
    TextToSpeechSetMode                 @100
    TextToSpeechGetMode                 @101
    TextToSpeechSetLog                  @102
    TextToSpeechGetLog                  @103
    TextToSpeechSetConsole              @104
    TextToSpeechPlayTones               @105
    TextToSpeechGetVoice                @106
    TextToSpeechSetVoice                @107
    TextToSpeechRun                     @108
    TextToSpeechGetEventHandle          @109
    TextToSpeechGetEvent                @110
